 lowest  rated Thrones installment in history  based on Rotten Tomatoes reviews the  episode stands at a 61 percent approval  rating on the aggregator site coming in  only a few percentage points above the  disturbing season 5 episode unbowed  unbent unbroken which earned a score of  54% Game of Thrones has only two  episodes remaining in its entire run and  it's anyone's guess how the show is  going to bounce back from this perceived  low point especially now that Daenerys  is on the brink team Targaryen is down  to important members Danny's trusted  advisors could turn their backs on her  at any moment and Jamie is plotting  something big for the sake of viewers  well-being and in hopes that Thrones  will go out on a high notes we have our  fingers crossed that the upcoming  episode doesn't ruffle quite as many  feathers as this one did check out one  of our newest videos right here plus  even more Luke  videos about Game of Thrones are coming  soon subscribe to our YouTube channel  and hit the bell so you don't miss a  single one  [Music]
 

